    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Wondrous Item, Rare (Requires Attunement by a Wizard)</em></p><p>Ragged scraps of red cloth cover this weathered tome. While attuned to it, you can use it as a spellbook and as an @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagArcaneFocus]{Arcane Focus}.</p><p><strong>Arcane Stamina.</strong> When you use your Arcane Recovery feature, you also regain Hit Points equal to 2d6 plus half your Wizard level (round down).</p><p><strong>Improved Spell Recall.</strong> When you use your Memorize Spell feature, you can replace one more level 1+ Wizard spell you have prepared for your Spellcasting feature with another level 1+ spell written in this book.</p>",
